            "review_title": "Review at Banh Mi 362",
            "review_text": "efrat-exploring\n640 contributions\n0\nExcellent Bahn Mi, offering many traditional and also creative fillings....\nApr 2018 • Family\nIf you are intimidated by street-food but too curious to skip Bahn Mi (THE Vietnamese sandwich) and/or if you wish you had other fillings to choose from (vegetarian, anchovies....) - this is the place for you. Clean, fresh, buns are super crisp, staff is friendly and it costs almost as the ones on the street. Delicious.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 15, 2018",
