            "review_text": "Mai B\n14 contributions\n0\nI love Banh Mi 362\nMay 2017 • Solo\nLove eating banh mi but i'm quiet afraid to have it in the morning as banh mi is usually dry and a little bit hard. But banh mi 362 is grilled right before being give to customers so the cover is really crispy, the crumb is dense for a full meal. Banh mi with chicken is delicious, the sauce is cheesy, chill sauce is also amazing.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 20, 2017",
